Leo: I will send you a draft tomorrow. Can you contact the estates team about access to the repair workshop?
Maya: Yes, I will do that. We should both conduct interviews so we can compare our impressions afterwards. I can enter the questionnaire data, and you could edit the final presentation.
Leo: That works. In the written report, let us include photographs of the repair space to help explain its layout. We must take them when the room is empty so no participant appears without permission.
Maya: Agreed. The photographs will support the description, while the interview evidence will carry our argument. I think we finally have a project we can complete well.
